          "description": "College-level Introduction to Computing & Microsoft 365 taught the way a community college Computer Concepts / Microcomputer Applications professor would teach it (GO! by Gaskin, MyITLab curriculum). Fourteen lessons covering computer fundamentals, Windows 11, file management, the Microsoft 365 ecosystem, OneDrive, Word/Excel/PowerPoint essentials, Outlook, Teams, OneNote, security and privacy, accessibility and Copilot AI, and a capstone integrated-workflow project.",
